14:["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","section","Trend signal or paid pile-on?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Trend signal or paid pile-on?"}],[["$","p","Seeing the same product repeatedly does not prove that buyers love it. Creators may share the same campaign, sample, or commission opportunity. Look for sustained interest across Pinterest searches, retailer reviews, and ordinary outfit posts—not one burst of nearly identical videos.",{"children":"Seeing the same product repeatedly does not prove that buyers love it. Creators may share the same campaign, sample, or commission opportunity. Look for sustained interest across Pinterest searches, retailer reviews, and ordinary outfit posts—not one burst of nearly identical videos."}],["$","p","Search the product name with words such as sizing, long-term review, return, sole, lining, and wash. Those searches expose practical problems that an unboxing cannot.",{"children":"Search the product name with words such as sizing, long-term review, return, sole, lining, and wash. Those searches expose practical problems that an unboxing cannot."}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","Five checks before checkout",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Five checks before checkout"}],[["$","p","Use the listing and your existing closet to answer all five.",{"children":"Use the listing and your existing closet to answer all five."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Outfit fit: can you name three things you already own that work with it?",{"children":"Outfit fit: can you name three things you already own that work with it?"}],["$","li","Material: does the listing state the actual fiber, lining, sole, or hardware composition?",{"children":"Material: does the listing state the actual fiber, lining, sole, or hardware composition?"}],["$","li","Sizing: are garment measurements available, and do recent reviewers describe consistency?",{"children":"Sizing: are garment measurements available, and do recent reviewers describe consistency?"}],["$","li","Comfort: do non-sponsored reviews mention walking, sitting, washing, or all-day wear?",{"children":"Comfort: do non-sponsored reviews mention walking, sitting, washing, or all-day wear?"}],["$","li","Return risk: is the return window usable if the color, fit, or construction disappoints?",{"children":"Return risk: is the return window usable if the color, fit, or construction disappoints?"}]]}]]}],["$","section","Shoes need a stricter test",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Shoes need a stricter test"}],[["$","p","A viral shoe can photograph beautifully and still be miserable after twenty minutes. Check toe-box shape, heel stability, sole flexibility, traction, and whether reviewers wore it for a full day rather than around a bedroom.",{"children":"A viral shoe can photograph beautifully and still be miserable after twenty minutes. Check toe-box shape, heel stability, sole flexibility, traction, and whether reviewers wore it for a full day rather than around a bedroom."}],["$","p","For look-alikes, compare construction and comfort—not just the silhouette. The cheapest dupe is not a bargain when it is worn once.",{"children":"For look-alikes, compare construction and comfort—not just the silhouette. The cheapest dupe is not a bargain when it is worn once."}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]
